# Extension performance

- Prefer official event APIs over aggressive polling (poll only as fallback with clear intervals)
- Avoid heavyweight dependencies; keep VSIX lean
- Lazy-load experience assets where practical
- Dispose watchers/timers; no work on every keystroke without debounce/budget
- Giphy/network must time-budget so celebrations are not blocked for long
